
{"id":"b1f8c98e-428b-4467-88ad-50b6e496616c","object":"chat.completion","created":1784983948,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    if 'nodes' not in case or 'required_symbols' not in case:\\n        raise ValueError('Missing required fields')\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    required_symbols = set(case['required_symbols'])\\n    for node in nodes:\\n        for key in ('id','parent','symbol','depth','removable'):\\n            if key not in node:\\n                raise ValueError('Node missing key: ' + key)\\n    node_map = {}\\n    children = {}\\n    for node in nodes:\\n        nid = node['id']\\n        node_map[nid] = node\\n        children[nid] = []\\n    for node in nodes:\\n        pid = node['parent']\\n        if pid is not None:\\n            children[pid].append(node['id'])\\n    retained = set(node_map.keys())\\n    symbol_counts = {}\\n    for node in nodes:\\n        sym = node['symbol']\\n        symbol_counts[sym] = symbol_counts.get(sym, 0) + 1\\n    sorted_nodes = sorted(node_map.values(), key=lambda n: (-n['depth'], n['id']))\\n    removal_order = []\\n    for node in sorted_nodes:\\n        nid = node['id']\\n        if not node['removable']:\\n            continue\\n        if any(child in retained for child in children[nid]):\\n            continue\\n        sym = node['symbol']\\n        if sym in required_symbols and symbol_counts.get(sym, 0) == 1:\\n            continue\\n        retained.remove(nid)\\n        symbol_counts[sym] -= 1\\n        removal_order.append(nid)\\n    removed_ids = removal_order\\n    retained_ids = sorted(retained)\\n    return {\\n        'removed_node_ids': removed_ids,\\n        'retained_node_ids': retained_ids\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) that takes a payload with nodes and required_symbols. The task is grammar-guided node reduction: we have a tree (nodes with parent 